### Exemplos de requisições (extensão "REST Client" do VS Code ou HTTP Client do IntelliJ)
### Depois do login, copie o access_token para a variável abaixo.
@base = http://localhost:8000
@token = COLE_AQUI_O_TOKEN

### Cadastro
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Maria Silva", "email": "maria@email.com", "password": "senha123"}

### Login (devolve o access_token)
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "maria@email.com", "password": "senha123"}

### Usuário logado (rota protegida)
GET {{base}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Criar tarefa
POST {{base}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "Estudar FastAPI", "description": "Ler a documentação"}

### Listar tarefas
GET {{base}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Buscar tarefa por ID
GET {{base}}/tasks/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Atualizar tarefa (parcial)
PUT {{base}}/tasks/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"done": true}

### Excluir tarefa
DELETE {{base}}/tasks/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Erro: rota protegida sem token (401)
GET {{base}}/tasks
